---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: "help(&[\"export\", \"--help\"])"
---
Write a build table of a project — the wire list, the connector pin tables or the bill of materials — as CSV or JSON

Usage: wirebug export <COMMAND>

Commands:
  wires       The wire list (cut list): one row per conductor — each segment of a multi-endpoint wire — and one per cable screen
  connectors  The connector pin tables (crimp sheet): one row per conductor or drain in each cavity, and one per empty cavity or port without a pin
  bom         The bill of materials: one row per thing to buy — housings by part, cables by type, loose wire by colour and gauge, components and splices by part — with its quantity per placement
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
